Thu May 15 2026 Michael Jansen <mike@michael-jansen.biz> - 0.8.0-5

- Move tarball creation from packaging/rpm/Makefile to top-level Makefile
- Packaging Makefile now only builds RPMs from pre-existing tarballs
- VERSION and NAME read from spec file (single source of truth)
- make dist creates tarballs; make packaging creates tarballs then builds RPMs

